+<section class="shell section" id="faq"><div class="section-heading"><div class="eyebrow">Good to know</div><h2>Questions, answered.</h2></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I change plans later?</summary><p>Absolutely. Upgrade or downgrade whenever you need to; your plan changes take effect right away.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing and pay 20% less per user than the monthly rate. The full annual amount is billed upfront.</p></details><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><p>Yes. The Free plan is free forever, and you can explore Relay with your team before upgrading.</p></details><details><summary>What happens when my team grows?</summary><p>Add teammates whenever you like. Team and Business plans scale with your team, and you can manage members from your workspace settings.</p></details><details><summary>Can I cancel at any time?</summary><p>Yes. There are no long-term contracts. You can cancel from your workspace settings at any time.</p></details></div></section>
